# Error Handling

Handle failures gracefully.

## Never

- Swallow exceptions.
- Leave empty catch blocks.
- Ignore coroutine failures.

## Always

Return meaningful Result or State objects.

Log useful debugging information.

Show user-friendly error messages.

Recover whenever possible.

## Coroutines

Use structured concurrency.

Handle CancellationException correctly.

Don't convert cancellation into failure.

## Validation

Validate

- input
- permissions
- null values
- API responses

before use.